Z||000004||Rumor||12-01-2001||11:54 PM||||That's funny about the tail-light messages...<P> be wary of those "ultra blue" light bulbs, they get WAY too hot - I put them in the interior overhead lights, and discovered that they do a GREAT job of melting the plastic covers...*smacks his head*<P>Anyone have plans for mounting an EMP device in their car?<P>Remember when people knew what turn signals were for?<P>(sighs DEEPLY)<BR>Getting back on topic, i read a post where one guy had melted his tail light when he used a halogen bulb that was too powerful...<BR>why not use Bright wide-angle or small-focus LEDs?<BR> <A HREF="http://www.antsnest.net/Garage/LEDs.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.antsnest.net/Garage/LEDs.html</A> <BR>||||reg||1
